# Production build values. Committed on purpose: nothing here is secret (Vite
# inlines every VITE_ key into the bundle) and a deploy that depends on someone
# remembering to set a dashboard variable is a deploy that breaks silently.

VITE_LENDER_SLUG=micromart

# Failover is NOT armed in production. Until /api/portal/otp/verify issues a
# bearer token, the fallback road cannot carry a signed-in borrower's session —
# see the header comment in src/lib/net/transport.ts. An unset value means the
# app runs on the primary alone, which is what the app it replaces does today.
VITE_API_FALLBACK=
